// Title: JXA In-memory Execution Via OSAScript
// ID: f1408a58-0e94-4165-b80a-da9f96cf6fc3
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31
// Tags: attack.t1059.002, attack.t1059.007, attack.execution
// Description: Detects possible malicious execution of JXA in-memory via OSAScript
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " -l ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "JavaScript"))) OR (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".js"))) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "osascript") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " -e ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "eval") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "NSData.dataWithContentsOfURL"))))
